OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells initially. However, it
OL,7,Fwill cloud over from the west after
OL,8,Fmidnight, with outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Farriving. Strengthening southwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds, with risk of coastal gales by
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cloudy and wet start
OL,14,FSaturday morning with heavier bursts
OL,15,Fover the hills. Rain becoming less
OL,16,Fpersistent through the afternoon with
OL,17,Fsome bright spells later. Remaining
OL,18,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
